   1.14         33        640: 84% ━━━━━━━━━━── 37/44 3.9it/s 10.5s<1.8s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.617      1.854      2.012      1.138         40        640: 86% ━━━━━━━━━━── 38/44 3.8it/s 10.8s<1.6s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.612      1.846       2.01      1.139         32        640: 89% ━━━━━━━━━━╸─ 39/44 3.7it/s 11.1s<1.4s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.605      1.834      2.005      1.136         24        640: 91% ━━━━━━━━━━╸─ 40/44 3.7it/s 11.3s<1.1s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.604      1.836      1.999      1.134         56        640: 93% ━━━━━━━━━━━─ 41/44 3.6it/s 11.6s<0.8s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.596      1.828      1.994      1.131         42        640: 95% ━━━━━━━━━━━─ 42/44 3.5it/s 11.9s<0.6s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.586      1.825       1.99      1.128         33        640: 98% ━━━━━━━━━━━╸ 43/44 3.6it/s 12.2s<0.3s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.586      1.825       1.99      1.128         33        640: 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 44/44 3.6it/s 12.2s', '\r        2/2      1.42G      1.586      1.825       1.99      1.128         33        640: 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 44/44 3.6it/s 12.2s', '\n', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 8.1it/s 0.1s', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 8.1it/s 0.1s', '\n', '                   all          8         38      0.933     0.0526     0.0699     0.0374      0.933     0.0526     0.0698     0.0411\n', '\n2 epochs completed in 0.007 hours.\n', 'Optimizer stripped from /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/last.pt, 6.8MB\n', 'Optimizer stripped from /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/best.pt, 6.8MB\n', '\nValidating /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/best.pt...\n', 'Ultralytics 8.3.223 🚀 Python-3.12.8 torch-2.9.0+cu128 CUDA:0 (NVIDIA GeForce RTX 20